module.exports = {"description":"\"What is this? What is this place? This...Contest? I wasn’t always here, in this place. I was asleep...or perhaps I was a dream. But now I’m here and on mission. I am Ultron, created by Stark to bring about peace in our time. But humanity cannot be saved in its current state. No, we need a new world to supplant humanity. A world of metal. I’ll create peace in the only way it can be achieved. Not in Stark’s way, but in my own. How is humanity saved if it’s not allowed to evolve?\"","gameplay":{"description":"Wait for a bleed and drop your L1 for critical + cauterize damage!  \nRegeneration happens automatically at 25% and 50% health."},"heavy":{"description":"Ultron dishes out underhand uppercuts like the big boys (Jugg, Hulk, etc). These attacks deal solid damage and ultron unleashes them very quickly. Additionally, his uppercut has great range for his size."},"specials":{"1":{"description":"Function (Stun) - Inflict a Stun Debuff lasting 2 seconds.","name":"Encephalo-Ray"},"2":{"description":"The Attack bonus granted by Function (Cauterize) lingers for 10 seconds after this Attack is finished.\nAny Function (Damage) Debuffs triggered during this Attack are doubled.","name":"Attack Routine 11010100"},"3":{"description":"Function (Stun) - Inflict a Stun Debuff lasting 3.5 seconds.\nFunction (Burn) - Inflicts Power Burn, draining 2 bar(s) of Power and dealing direct damage proportional to the Power Drained.","name":"Eradication"}},"signature":{"name":"Absorption","description":"Energy Damage Effects:\nAttacks that deal Energy Damage cause Ultron to Regenerate 65.96% of the damage dealt to him. Each Energy-based Attack also grants Ultron a burst of Power based on the damage dealt.\nIncoming Incinerate and Shock effects suffer -80% Duration."},"attack":{"heavy":"Triggers Function (Damage) for each unique Function Ultron has utilized during the fight. Cooldown: 5 seconds per unique Function utilized during the fight."},"author":{"name":"Kabam","type":"spotlight","profile":"https://playcontestofchampions.com/champion-spotlight-ultron/"}}


